					"text": "This 4D application allows you to perform semantic search on a set of icons (the Material Design icons by Google, available at https://fonts.google.com/icons).  An OpenAI key will be needed in order to transform the text prompt into a vector.  An ORDA query will then retrieve the best vector matches and display a list of icons ranked by similarity to the search prompt.",
